{"audio": "james-02.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 172000, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1067, "text": "James, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 1067, "end_ms": 6800, "text": "My brethren, have not the faith of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Lord of glory, with respect of persons."}, {"start_ms": 6800, "end_ms": 24267, "text": "For if there come unto your assembly a man with a gold ring, in goodly apparel, and there come in also a poor man in vile raiment; And ye have respect to him that weareth the gay clothing, and say unto him, Sit thou here in a good place; and say to the poor, Stand thou there,"}, {"start_ms": 24267, "end_ms": 30000, "text": "or sit here under my footstool: Are ye not then partial in yourselves, and are become judges of evil thoughts?"}, {"start_ms": 30000, "end_ms": 39067, "text": "Hearken, my beloved brethren, Hath not God chosen the poor of this world rich in faith, and heirs of the kingdom which he hath promised to them that love him?"}, {"start_ms": 39067, "end_ms": 41333, "text": "But ye have despised the poor."}, {"start_ms": 41333, "end_ms": 46000, "text": "Do not rich men oppress you, and draw you before the judgment seats?"}, {"start_ms": 46000, "end_ms": 50133, "text": "Do not they blaspheme that worthy name by the which ye are called?"}, {"start_ms": 50133, "end_ms": 62400, "text": "If ye fulfil the royal law according to the scripture, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself, ye do well: But if ye have respect to persons, ye commit sin, and are convinced of the law as transgressors."}, {"start_ms": 62400, "end_ms": 67733, "text": "For whosoever shall keep the whole law, and yet offend in one point, he is guilty of all."}, {"start_ms": 67733, "end_ms": 71867, "text": "For he that said, Do not commit adultery, said also, Do not kill."}, {"start_ms": 71867, "end_ms": 77600, "text": "Now if thou commit no adultery, yet if thou kill, thou art become a transgressor of the law."}, {"start_ms": 77600, "end_ms": 82800, "text": "So speak ye, and so do, as they that shall be judged by the law of liberty."}, {"start_ms": 82800, "end_ms": 89467, "text": "For he shall have judgment without mercy, that hath shewed no mercy; and mercy rejoiceth against judgment."}, {"start_ms": 89467, "end_ms": 95200, "text": "What doth it profit, my brethren, though a man say he hath faith, and have not works?"}, {"start_ms": 95200, "end_ms": 96400, "text": "can faith save him?"}, {"start_ms": 96400, "end_ms": 110400, "text": "If a brother or sister be naked, and destitute of daily food, And one of you say unto them, Depart in peace, be ye warmed and filled; notwithstanding ye give them not those things which are needful to the body; what doth it profit?"}, {"start_ms": 110400, "end_ms": 114933, "text": "Even so faith, if it hath not works, is dead, being alone."}, {"start_ms": 114933, "end_ms": 122933, "text": "Yea, a man may say, Thou hast faith, and I have works: shew me thy faith without thy works, and I will shew thee my faith by my works."}, {"start_ms": 122933, "end_ms": 129867, "text": "Thou believest that there is one God; thou doest well: the devils also believe, and tremble."}, {"start_ms": 129867, "end_ms": 134000, "text": "But wilt thou know, O vain man, that faith without works is dead?"}, {"start_ms": 134000, "end_ms": 139067, "text": "Was not Abraham our father justified by works, when he had offered Isaac his son upon the altar?"}, {"start_ms": 139067, "end_ms": 144133, "text": "Seest thou how faith wrought with his works, and by works was faith made perfect?"}, {"start_ms": 144133, "end_ms": 153467, "text": "And the scripture was fulfilled which saith, Abraham believed God, and it was imputed unto him for righteousness: and he was called the Friend of God."}, {"start_ms": 153467, "end_ms": 159467, "text": "Ye see then how that by works a man is justified, and not by faith only."}, {"start_ms": 159467, "end_ms": 167200, "text": "Likewise also was not Rahab the harlot justified by works, when she had received the messengers, and had sent them out another way?"}, {"start_ms": 167200, "end_ms": 172000, "text": "For as the body without the spirit is dead, so faith without works is dead also."}], "words": [{"t": "James,", "s": 101, "e": 383, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 443, "e": 725, "si": 0}, {"t": "Two.", "s": 785, "e": 946, "si": 0}, {"t": "My", "s": 1548, "e": 1648, "si": 1}, {"t": "brethren,", "s": 1688, "e": 2009, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 2210, "e": 2370, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 2410, "e": 2550, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 2590, "e": 2671, "si": 1}, {"t": "faith", "s": 2731, "e": 2951, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 2991, "e": 3052, "si": 1}, {"t": "our", "s": 3092, "e": 3192, "si": 1}, {"t": "Lord", "s": 3232, "e": 3432, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus", "s": 3472, "e": 3813, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ,", "s": 3873, "e": 4234, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4374, "e": 4455, "si": 1}, {"t": "Lord", "s": 4515, "e": 4715, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 4755, "e": 4816, "si": 1}, {"t": "glory,", "s": 4856, "e": 5196, "si": 1}, {"t": "with", "s": 5577, "e": 5698, "si": 1}, {"t": "respect", "s": 5738, "e": 6159, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 6199, "e": 6259, "si": 1}, {"t": "persons.", "s": 6299, "e": 6760, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 7520, "e": 7640, "si": 2}, {"t": "if", "s": 7700, "e": 7760, "si": 2}, {"t": "there", "s": 7800, "e": 7940, "si": 2}, {"t": "come", "s": 7960, "e": 8161, "si": 2}, {"t": "unto", "s": 8181, "e": 8381, "si": 2}, {"t": "your", "s": 8461, "e": 8601, "si": 2}, {"t": "assembly", "s": 8641, "e": 9121, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 9181, "e": 9201, "si": 2}, {"t": "man", "s": 9281, "e": 9501, "si": 2}, {"t": "with", "s": 9561, "e": 9681, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 9701, "e": 9721, "si": 2}, {"t": "gold", "s": 9781, "e": 10061, "si": 2}, {"t": "ring,", "s": 10161, "e": 10441, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 10702, "e": 10782, "si": 2}, {"t": "goodly", "s": 10862, "e": 11162, "si": 2}, {"t": "apparel,", "s": 11202, "e": 11682, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 12342, "e